==Notes==
{{gw2w}}
*An Oni ally can be summoned using a [[Demonic Summoning Stone]] or a [[Mysterious Summoning Stone]].
*The Oni's idle [[emote]] is an unusual beckoning or stretching gesture, easily observed by summoning friendly [[Oni (summon)|Oni]].
*There is a rare [[miniature]] [[Miniature Oni|version]] of these creatures.
*In addition to the Oni weapons listed above, Oni in Echovald Forest and The Jade Sea can [[drop]] weapons that only [[:Category:Echovald Forest wildlife|Echovald Forest wildlife]] and [[:Category:The Jade Sea wildlife|The Jade Sea wildlife]] can drop (e.g. [[:Category:Amber weapons|Amber weapons]] and [[:Category:Jade weapons|Jade weapons]]), respectively.

==Trivia==
*In [[w:Oni (folklore)|Japanese folklore]], oni are either invisible spirits or gods that cause disasters and have a taste for human flesh, or large brutish ogre-like creatures with claws and a pair of horns.

